  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Tribalco shows $376M in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Tribalco received 146 awards for the period, and Tribalco has an average award size of $2.6M. Tribalco obligations are up 291.2% year over year. Tribalco received $347M from the Department of Homeland Security, which is the largest single-agency buyer for FY2026 to date. Tribalco’s activity is concentrated in Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing at $347M. Tribalco also has FY2026 obligations in Other Computer Related Services at $15.2M and in Surgical Appliance and Supplies Manufacturing at $8M. Tribalco’s historical obligations were $146M in FY21, $128M in FY22, $138M in FY23, $87.1M in FY24, and $96.1M in FY25. Tribalco’s top-buying agencies after DHS are the General Services Administration at $16.6M and the Department of Defense at $8M. Tribalco’s FY2026 totals are partial, covering the fiscal year to date, and the listed award values in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables are total contract values rather than obligations.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Who are Tribalco's biggest buyers this fiscal year?",
        "body": "The Department of Homeland Security is Tribalco's largest buyer in FY2026 to date at $347M. The General Services Administration follows at $16.6M and the Department of Defense follows at $8M. The Department of State obligated $3.8M, and the Department of the Interior, Department of Commerce, and Department of Health and Human Services obligated $556K, $154K, and $152K respectively."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which markets drive Tribalco's FY2026 obligations?",
        "body": "Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing is Tribalco's largest market at $347M. Other Computer Related Services accounts for $15.2M and Surgical Appliance and Supplies Manufacturing accounts for $8M. Additional NAICS categories include Wireless Telecommunications Carriers (except Satellite) at $1.7M and All Other Miscellaneous General Purpose Machinery Manufacturing at $1.7M, with amounts down to $152K in Specialized Automotive Repair."
      }
    ]
  },
